meta {
  name: 09 Validate
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/lab-reports/{{labReportId}}/validate
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "notes": "Values reviewed against reference ranges — within expected limits."
  }
}

docs {
  Validation Pending → Result Done (LABORATORY.docx §2.2, §6.4). `notes` is
  optional; when present it's recorded as a TECH note on the report.

  If the test has a Reporting Time / Approval Duration configured (Turnaround
  Time Details modal — SRS §5.4/§5.5) and this result lands after today's
  cutoff (`reportingTimeTo - approvalDurationMaxValue`), the report is stamped
  with `reportingDeferredUntil` = the next scheduled Reporting session's start.
  Status still becomes RESULT_DONE either way — see "13 Approve", which
  enforces the deferral.

  404 `LAB_REPORT_NOT_FOUND`. 409 `LAB_REPORT_LOCKED`. 409
  `INVALID_LAB_REPORT_TRANSITION` if the report isn't Validation Pending.
}
